---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Field, InputGroup, TextField } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="InputGroup">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>InputGroup</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Joins addons and controls into one unit with flat inner edges: prefix
      labels, suffix units, attached buttons.
    </p>

    <h2>Price with unit</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <Field id="price" label="Price">
        <InputGroup>
          <span class="ink-input" style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: auto; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-ink) 4%, var(--ink-bg));">$</span>
          <TextField id="price" label="Price" hideLabel />
          <span class="ink-input" style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: auto; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink-ink) 4%, var(--ink-bg));">/mo</span>
        </InputGroup>
      </Field>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Field id="price" label="Price"&gt;
  &lt;InputGroup&gt;
    &lt;span class="ink-input"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;TextField id="price" label="Price" hideLabel /&gt;
    &lt;span class="ink-input"&gt;/mo&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;/InputGroup&gt;
&lt;/Field&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>class</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Passthrough.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li>Addons are text, not inputs: keep them short and decorative.</li>
      <li>The <code>Field</code> wrapper outside still wires label and messages.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
